Revision history for perl-json-validator-schema-troglodyne

1.001 2026-11-07 TEODESIAN
    - Add the keyword x-errorMessage, which gives a failed keyword of a schema
      a message of its own, such as for not, in place of Should not match.
    - Require JSON::Validator 5.19, the oldest release that the tests passed on.

1.000 2026-08-27 TEODESIAN
    - Initial Release
